{"server":"cn","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_01_end","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_01","title":"日正当中","storyCode":"GT-1","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"e5ed7ca6bcf72687014644548aeb872cc5591cb3af20872ee92bf2f10bc94447","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走廊好黑！而且好挤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不、不好意思，虽然方便藏身，可毕竟这里只是个小阁楼而已！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"磨坊，粮仓，电房，村子里的很多设施都被赏金猎人破坏了，他们不会在乎这种小地方的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是这样没错......唔，我们两个居然刚好能挤进这种缝隙里？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可萝尔，脸是不是贴的太近了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......那个，骑警大人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别叫我骑警大人啦，叫我格拉尼就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"那，格拉尼，你刚才说你接到了我们村子希望找到骑士宝藏的委托......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"对，而且委托里还提到，你确实已经拥有完整的宝藏信息了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"打开宝藏必要的钥匙和宝藏的位置，都是历代村长口口相传的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"具体的我暂时还不能说......抱歉，我不是有意要向你隐瞒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题的，至少等到你完全相信我之后再说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"那些赏金猎人得知了这些情报，就一直在威胁着村民们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"他们破坏村子的田地，抢走越冬的储粮，骚扰村民——如果那时我不站出来，村子就真的要完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"只要让他们知道宝藏的情报在我这里，至少他们不再去伤害其他村民们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"但就算你受了那样的苦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，我很清楚，这不过是权宜之计。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"还好，你来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"呜，可萝尔小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然委托内容是希望有人能来帮我们找到宝藏，但其实我们希望的也只是驱逐那些赏金猎人、让村子恢复安宁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"宝藏对我们来说，是现在唯一的解决手段而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"金币什么的，总会有花光的一天，但我们一直要在这片土地上生活下去，土地是我们唯一的故乡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"用宝藏去雇佣别人驱逐赏金猎人，也可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"有足够的活动资金的话，甚至能雇佣一小支佣军呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"既然目的已经明确，那当务之急，果然还是要先离开这个满是流氓的村子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"这边有窗子，能看到外——呃，好像有点高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可萝尔小姐，你能试试从这个窗户看到外面吗，赏金猎人还在找我们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我也够不到，窗户还是太高了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"让我抱你起来......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！现在能看到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，我能看到了————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可萝尔小姐！别乱动呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可那个，那是什么呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才，有个人，从窗户外飞了过去......?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["格拉尼"]}]}
